{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XhyZMpdAoB1794789860.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美股三大指數急挫，道指跌739點，納指跌2%，費城半導體指數跌5%；美匯逾一年半高，港股料低開逾200點。</p><p><strong>美股重挫 港股承壓</strong><br/>美股向下，道指跌739點，納指跌2%，費半跌5%。美匯逾一年半高。受外圍影響，港股料低開逾200點。</p><p><strong>輝達與美匯消息</strong><br/>輝達跌4%，傳董事會不考慮黃仁勳復職；特朗普撐無危害國家。</p><p><strong>AI與聯儲局動向</strong><br/>美國堵海外使用AI算力漏洞。聯儲局方面，沃什稱正推演AI影響應急方案；哈馬克稱傾向較小幅度加息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T01:46:08.474860+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T00:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:10.777615+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T01:39:32.382886+00:00","content_hash":"ff7f3dea1a674178b33113bb1d844074b1e2a247bb3618c3d302729e73e0ee9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T01:46:08.474860+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}